# A page object: the cart. See pages/shop.hunt for how these are used.
#
# {code} and {product} are set by the hunt that uses the block.

@context: Page object: the cart
@title: Page - Cart

STEP 1: Apply the promo code
    FILL 'Promo code' field with '{code}'
    CLICK the 'Apply' button
    VERIFY that 'Promo code applied' is present

STEP 2: Remove the product
    CLICK the 'Remove' button NEAR '{product}'
    VERIFY that '{product} removed' is present

STEP 3: Go to checkout
    CLICK the 'Checkout' button
    VERIFY that 'Full name' is present
DONE.
